Note that $\lim_{{\tau} \nearrow j\gamma} Z_{\tau} = Y_j =  \lim_{{\tau} \searrow j\gamma} Z_{\tau}$ for each $j$, and thus $\{Z_{\tau}\}$ is a continuous process. 
We introduce another stochastic process $\{X_{\tau}\}$, defined by 
\[
