Now, recall the generalized Young's inequality, $ab \leq \frac{s^\alpha a^\alpha}{\alpha} + \frac{s^{-\beta}b^\beta}{\beta}$ for $s>0$, $a,b,\alpha,\beta>0$ such that $\frac{1}{\alpha}+\frac{1}{\beta}=1$.
