\bigg ] - \mathbb{E} \bigg [ \sum_{t=T+1}^{t_{n_T+1} - 1} ( c (x_t, u_t) - J (\bar{\theta}_*))  \bigg ]\\&:= R_1 + R_2 + R_3 + R_4 + R_5,
